  values ('ME', 'analytical', '"The recommendation of the National Assembly''s Economic and Finance Committee on the need to allocate Project Tied Assistance (PTA) and Small Development Project (SDP) resources to local governments using a Resource Allocation Formula has not been passed. Currently, this formula is used only for block grant allocation. During the National Assembly session held on 19 June 2024, 21 members supported the recommendation and 24 opposed it, making it ineffective."

b) Discuss the potential advantages and disadvantages of implementing a Resource Allocation Formula (RAF) for PTA and SDP in Bhutan. (10 marks)', 'b) Advantages: (1) equity - resources reach all LGs according to objective need; (2) transparency and accountability - everyone knows how allocations are made; (3) reduces political and discretionary influence; (4) predictability strengthens local planning and decentralisation; (5) supports balanced regional development and reduces disparities.
Disadvantages: (1) projects such as roads, bridges or irrigation schemes are large and specific, so spreading funds by formula may leave each LG with too little to complete meaningful projects; (2) PTA funds come with donor conditions and sector priorities that may not match a formula; (3) a formula may not capture special needs (disasters, unique geography); (4) LGs may lack capacity to plan and implement larger budgets; (5) it can be rigid and slow to respond to emerging priorities.', null, '[{"point": "Advantages: equity and transparency, objective and predictable, reduces lobbying and political influence, supports decentralisation and LG planning, balanced development", "marks": 5}, {"point": "Disadvantages: projects are lumpy/ specific (needs-based not formula), may not match priorities or donor conditions, LG capacity limits, formula may not capture needs, rigidity, small allocations may be spread thin", "marks": 5}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development') and t.slug = 'local-government-and-public-finance'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-general-3'), 'standard', 10,
