  values ('ME', 'analytical', 'According to the Public Debt Situation Report for the quarter ending 30 June 2024, total public debt stock reached Nu 285 billion, a decrease of almost Nu 8 billion compared with Nu 293 billion as of 31 March 2024. The debt comprises external debt of over Nu 263 billion and domestic debt of over Nu 21 billion. External debt makes up 92.5 percent of the total.

a) Discuss the implications of the Nu 8 billion reduction in total public debt stock between 31 March 2024 and 30 June 2024. What factors could have contributed to this decrease, and how might it affect our economic outlook? (5 marks)', 'a) The reduction of about Nu 8 billion in one quarter may result from scheduled principal repayments of external loans - particularly hydropower loans from the Government of India and multilateral loans - and repayment or redemption of domestic borrowing (treasury bills and bonds), together with exchange rate movements that reduce the ngultrum value of foreign-currency debt, and limited new borrowing. Implications: a lower debt stock reduces the debt burden and risk of distress, frees fiscal space and improves Bhutan''s creditworthiness, giving a more positive economic outlook - provided it reflects genuine repayment and prudent policy rather than temporary exchange rate effects, and borrowing needs for development (13th FYP, GMC) remain under control.', null, '[{"point": "Factors: principal repayments (e.g. hydropower loans to GoI, other external loans), redemption of domestic bonds/ T-bills, exchange rate movements (rupee/ USD), lower new borrowing; implications: lower debt burden and risk, better fiscal space and credit standing, positive outlook if sustained (but check if due to temporary factors)", "marks": 5}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development') and t.slug = 'public-debt-and-the-economy'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-general-3'), 'standard', 5,
    540, 'historical_official', 'awaiting_review',
    null, null,
    '{"verdict": "pass", "issues": [], "checker_notes": "Model answer, marking guide and rubric written by Claude from the RCSC paper; facts were checked against what is widely published, but please read before publishing. Real past-paper questions keep RCSC wording.", "batch": "ME Paper III (General): BCSE 2024, batch 2", "source": {"title": "BCSE 2024 Main Examination, General category, Paper III", "year": 2024, "url": "https://rcsc.gov.bt/bcse-past-question-papers/"}}'::jsonb, 'me-general-3-2024b2-b5', 1, null, null, null, null)
  returning id
)
